<div data-cmp-is="text" class="bcl-text   " data-component="bcl-text" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-4160b8af61&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;akamai/components/brand-cl/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-10-21T12:53:30Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>On October 21, 2026, &lt;a href=\&#34;https://www.php.net/archive/2026.php#2026-10-20-1\&#34; target=\&#34;_blank\&#34;>PHP released a security advisory remedying two severe security flaws&lt;/a>, each carrying a CVSS v4.0 rating of 9.2.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>&lt;a href=\&#34;https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-109618\&#34; target=\&#34;_blank\&#34;>CVE-2026-109618&lt;/a>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>&lt;a href=\&#34;https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-109619\&#34; target=\&#34;_blank\&#34;>CVE-2026-109619&lt;/a>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>The patches are available immediately and users are urged to upgrade to fixed releases as soon as possible.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}">
     
   
    <p>On October 21, 2026, <a href="https://www.php.net/archive/2026.php#2026-10-20-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PHP released a security advisory remedying two severe security flaws</a>, each carrying a CVSS v4.0 rating of 9.2.</p>
<ul><li><p><a href="https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-109618" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CVE-2026-109618</a> </p>
</li><li><p><a href="https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-109619" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CVE-2026-109619</a> </p>
</li></ul>
<p>The patches are available immediately and users are urged to upgrade to fixed releases as soon as possible. </p>

       
    
       
